      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Iam User\narn:aws:iam::777459807044:user/\nmaster-programmatic-admin\n\nStep-0 Code : aws sts get-caller-identity --profile master-programmatic-admin\nSecurity Credential - create access key for CLI\nAKIA3KBBXGNCHZGLLFVV \n0oN/Q3vkn4j5km4MYzkPyyx53LWEd4WAHzp2OUaR\n\naws configure , key in Security credential       1\nprofile master-programmatic-admin\nregion= ap-southeast-1\noutput=json \n\ncat ~/.aws/credentials - to see what credentials you have\ncat ~/.aws/config -to see what config you have  \n\nCode : aws sts get-caller-identity --profile master-programmatic-admin\n\n\n\n\nPermission policy\narn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AdministratorAccess\n{\n    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n    \"Statement\": [\n        {\n            \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n            \"Action\": \"*\",\n            \"Resource\": \"*\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n",
      "fontSize": 15.341666666666667,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Iam User\narn:aws:iam::777459807044:user/\nmaster-programmatic-admin\n\nStep-0 Code : aws sts get-caller-identity --profile master-programmatic-admin\nSecurity Credential - create access key for CLI\nAKIA3KBBXGNCHZGLLFVV \n0oN/Q3vkn4j5km4MYzkPyyx53LWEd4WAHzp2OUaR\n\naws configure , key in Security credential       1\nprofile master-programmatic-admin\nregion= ap-southeast-1\noutput=json \n\ncat ~/.aws/credentials - to see what credentials you have\ncat ~/.aws/config -to see what config you have  \n\nCode : aws sts get-caller-identity --profile master-programmatic-admin\n\n\n\n\nPermission policy\narn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AdministratorAccess\n{\n    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n    \"Statement\": [\n        {\n            \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n            \"Action\": \"*\",\n            \"Resource\": \"*\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
